\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O come, ye sinners, to your Lord, 
\par In Christ to paradise restored: 
\par His proffered benefits embrace,
\par The plenitude of gospel grace:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. A pardon written with His blood,
\par The favour and the peace of God,
\par The seeing eye, the feeling sense,
\par The mystic joys of penitence;
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. The godly grief, the pleasing smart,
\par The meltings of a broken heart,
\par The tears that tell your sins forgiven,
\par The sighs that waft your souls to heaven;
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The guiltless shame, the sweet distress,
\par The unutterable tenderness,
\par The genuine, meek humility,
\par The wonder- Why such love to me?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. The o'erwhelming power of saving grace,
\par The sight that veils the seraph's face;
\par The speechless awe that dares not move,
\par And all the silent heaven of love.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

